  "description": "<h2>Scholarship overview</h2>\n<p>This joint Leeds–China Scholarship Council route combines university tuition support with CSC maintenance funding. It is intended for eligible Chinese applicants seeking doctoral study at Leeds, and requires the university and CSC application stages to be completed under their separate rules.</p>\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Eligible Leeds PhD subjects</li><li>Doctoral research</li><li>International research training</li></ul>\n<h2>Funding and duration</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Award or position</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">PhD scholarship / studentship</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Stipend / salary</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">CSC maintenance allowance; amount not stated</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Applicant eligibility</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Eligible Chinese citizens</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Further conditions</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Chinese citizens meeting CSC rules; Leeds tuition support and CSC living support.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Application dates</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Recruitment status</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Open</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Deadline / consideration round</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">6 January 2027, 17:00 UK time</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Location</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">United Kingdom</td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>About the University of Leeds</h2>\n<p>Leeds offers research degrees through its schools, institutes and doctoral training programmes. Its funding routes include subject-specific studentships, university scholarships and awards with particular nationality or widening participation criteria.</p>\n<p><strong>Official details:</strong> <a href=\"https://phd.leeds.ac.uk/funding/472-china-scholarship-council-university-of-leeds-scholarships-2027\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read the programme or project information</a></p>\n<p><strong>Application route:</strong> <a href=\"https://phd.leeds.ac.uk/funding/472-china-scholarship-council-university-of-leeds-scholarships-2027\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Follow the official application instructions</a></p>\n<h2>How to Apply</h2><p>Submit your application through the official portal before the deadline: 6 January 2027, 17:00 UK time. Read the eligibility requirements carefully and prepare all requested documents — early applications are strongly recommended for competitive awards.</p><p><a href=\"https://phd.leeds.ac.uk/funding/472-china-scholarship-council-university-of-leeds-scholarships-2027\">Open the official application page ↗</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-write-academic-cv-phd-applications-sample\">Academic CV for PhD Applications: Structure and an Example</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-apply-uk-student-visa-step-by-step-2026-2027\">UK Student Visa Application: CAS, Documents and Financial Evidence</a></li></ul>",
